rence between the short fatha (a) and the long alif (aa), as in بَر and بار. Then listen to verses from the Quran.","ur":"Suniye aur dohraiye. Chhoti fatha (a) aur lambi alif (aa) mein farq suniye, jaise بَر aur بار. Phir Quran ki aayaat sunein.","ar":"اِسْتَمِعْ وَكَرِّرْ. مَيِّزْ بَيْنَ الفَتْحَةِ القَصيرَةِ وَالأَلِفِ الطَّويلَةِ كَما في «بَر» وَ«بار». ثُمَّ اسْتَمِعْ إِلى آياتٍ مِنَ القُرْآنِ الكَريمِ."},"vocab":[{"ar":"مُسافِر","tr":"musāfir","en":"traveller","ur":"musafir"},{"ar":"قادِم","tr":"qādim","en":"arriving","ur":"aane wala"},{"ar":"ساعَة","tr":"sāʿa","en":"hour / clock","ur":"ghanta / ghari"},{"ar":"نَهار","tr":"nahār","en":"daytime","ur":"din"},{"ar":"جَمَل","tr":"jamal","en":"camel","ur":"oont"}],"quiz":[{"q":{"en":"Which word has a long 'aa' sound?","ur":"Kis lafz mein lambi 'aa' ki awaaz hai?","ar":"أَيُّ كَلِمَةٍ فيها مَدٌّ بِالأَلِفِ؟"},"options":["بار","بَر","سَبَ","جَمَل"],"answer":0},{"q":{"en":"What does مَطار mean?","ur":"مَطار ka matlab?","ar":"ما «المَطار»؟"},"options":["airport","officer","hour","traveller"],"answer":0,"options_ar":["مَكانٌ تَهْبِطُ فيهِ الطّائِراتُ","مُوَظَّفٌ في الجَوازاتِ","سِتّونَ دَقيقَةً","شَخْصٌ يُسافِرُ"]},{"q":{"en":"What does مُسافِر mean?","ur":"مُسافِر ka matlab?","ar":"مَنِ «المُسافِر»؟"},"options":["traveller","officer","passport","hotel"],"answer":0,"options_ar":["شَخْصٌ يَنْتَقِلُ مِنْ بَلَدٍ إِلى بَلَدٍ","مُوَظَّفُ الجَوازاتِ","وَثيقَةُ السَّفَرِ","مَكانُ النَّوْمِ"]},{"q":{"en":"In Arabic, the short vowel fatha sounds like...","ur":"Arabi mein chhoti fatha ki awaaz kaisi hai?","ar":"كَيْفَ تُنْطَقُ الفَتْحَةُ القَصيرَةُ؟"},"options":["a (short)","ee (long)","oo (long)","aa (long)"],"answer":0,"options_ar":["صَوْتٌ قَصيرٌ كَما في «بَ»","صَوْتٌ طَويلٌ كَما في «بي»","صَوْتٌ طَويلٌ كَما في «بو»","صَوْتٌ طَويلٌ كَما في «با»"]},{"q":{"en":"What does ساعَة mean?","ur":"ساعَة ka matlab?","ar":"ما مَعْنى «ساعَة»؟"},"options":["hour / clock","day","month","week"],"answer":0,"options_ar":["وَحْدَةٌ مِنَ الزَّمَنِ وَآلَةٌ تُبَيِّنُهُ","جُزْءٌ مِنَ الأُسْبوعِ","ثَلاثونَ يَوْمًا","اِثْنا عَشَرَ شَهْرًا"]}]},{"n":7,"title":{"ar":"الكَلام: تَبادُلُ الحِوار","en":"Speaking: practise dialogues","ur":"Bolna: mukaalme ki mashq"},"intro":{"en":"Practise asking and answering with a partner: booking to a country, where the tickets and passports are, and where you come from and why.","ur":"Apne saathi ke saath sawal jawab ki mashq karein: kisi mulk ki booking, ticket aur passport kahan hain, aur aap kahan se aaye hain aur kyun.","ar":"تَدَرَّبْ مَعَ زَميلِكَ عَلى السُّؤالِ وَالجَوابِ: الحَجْزُ إِلى بَلَدٍ، وَمَكانُ التَّذاكِرِ وَالجَوازاتِ، وَمِنْ أَيْنَ تَأْتي وَلِماذا."},"dialogue":[{"who":"ط١","ar":"أَيَّ خِدْمَة؟","tr":"ayya khidma?","en":"Which service?","ur":"Aap ko kaunsi khidmat chahiye?"},{"who":"ط٢","ar":"لَدَيَّ حَجْزٌ إِلى السُّعودِيَّة، وَأُريدُ تَأْكيدَ الحَجْز.","tr":"ladayya ḥajzun ilā s-Suʿūdiyya, wa urīdu ta'kīda l-ḥajz","en":"I have a booking to Saudi Arabia and want to confirm it.","ur":"Meri Saudi Arabia ki booking hai, main use pakka karwana chahta hoon."},{"who":"ط١","ar":"أَيْنَ التَّذاكِرُ؟","tr":"ayna t-tadhākir?","en":"Where are the tickets?","ur":"Ticketein kahan hain?"},{"who":"ط٢","ar":"هَذِهِ هِيَ التَّذاكِرُ.","tr":"hādhihi hiya t-tadhākir","en":"Here are the tickets.","ur":"Yeh rahin ticketein."},{"who":"ط١","ar":"مِنْ أَيْنَ أَنْتَ قادِمٌ؟","tr":"min ayna anta qādim?","en":"Where are you coming from?","ur":"Aap kahan se aaye hain?"},{"who":"ط٢","ar":"أَنا قادِمٌ مِنْ بَنْغَلاديش.","tr":"anā qādimun min Banghlādīsh","en":"I am coming from Bangladesh.","ur":"Main Bangladesh se aaya hoon."},{"who":"ط١","ar":"هَلْ أَنْتَ قادِمٌ لِلزِّيارَةِ؟","tr":"hal anta qādimun liz-ziyāra?","en":"Have you come for a visit?","ur":"Kya aap ziyarat ke liye aaye hain?"},{"who":"ط٢","ar":"لا، أَنا قادِمٌ لِلْعَمَل.","tr":"lā, anā qādimun lil-ʿamal","en":"No, I came for work.","ur":"Nahin, main kaam ke liye aaya hoon."}],"vocab":[{"ar":"خِدْمَة","tr":"khidma","en":"service","u